OL,3,GNEWSALeague Two footballer charged with
OL,4,Arape
OL,5,
OL,6,FLeague Two footballer Isiah
OL,7,FNoel-Williams has been charged with
OL,8,Frape.
OL,10,FNoel-Williams, who plays for League Two
OL,11,Fside Barnet, has been charged with
OL,12,Fthree counts of rape and one count of
OL,13,Fsexual assault by penetration,
OL,14,FHertfordshire Police said.
OL,16,FThe 23-year-old, of High Oaks, St
OL,17,FAlbans, was remanded in custody
OL,18,Ffollowing a hearing at Hatfield
OL,19,FMagistrates' Court on Saturday.
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
